# Contact Form Email Gateway Configuration
# This will make emails deliver directly to ayalewawokebit@gmail.com

# STEPS TO GET YOUR FREE WEB3FORMS ACCESS KEY:
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com/ (takes 2 minutes to sign up)
# 2. Click "Sign Up" - use your email ayalewawokebit@gmail.com
# 3. Check your email and verify your account
# 4. Go to Dashboard → Create New Form
# 5. Enter form name: "Portfolio Contact Form"
# 6. Set email destination: ayalewawokebit@gmail.com
# 7. Click "Create Form" 
# 8. Copy the Access Key (looks like: a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890)
# 9. Paste it below after VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
# 10. Save this file as .env (remove the .example extension)
# 11. Run: npm run build

